  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102459450-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, even if seismic connection means is provided to prevent deformation or damage in the valve chamber and piping connection part due to earthquake or external force, the seismic connection means is simply rigidly fixed to the valve chamber, and the seismic effect may be reduced due to reduced fluidity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200330013-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "concrete channel for seawater discharge is made by embedding and connecting precast concrete channel, and expansion joint device is provided at the connection part so that it can support some degree of external deformation such as heat deformation or earthquake due to temperature difference"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102916133-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "is inserted so that deformation of the pipe body (40) due to ground subsidence, earthquake, excessive load, or groundwater change can be detected in real time by embedding the strain gauge (50), and on the inner surface, a line groove (44)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102916133-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "wherein a receiving groove into which a strain gauge is inserted is formed on the outer surface of each of the pipe bodies so that deformation of the pipe body due to ground subsidence, earthquake, excessive load, or groundwater change can be detected in real time by embedding a strain gauge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102916133-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "meanwhile, a strain gauge (50) is embedded in the outer surface of each constructed pipe body (40) so that deformation of the pipe body (40) due to ground subsidence, earthquake, excessive load, or groundwater change can be detected in real time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102303480-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, in the case of joining concrete hume pipes, due to the nature of the structure in which the male and female hume pipes are joined together, when an earthquake or ground deformation occurs, stress is concentrated in the joint and local damage occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102316554-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, in the case of joining concrete hume pipes, due to the nature of the structure in which the male and female hume pipes are joined together, when an earthquake or ground deformation occurs, stress is concentrated in the joint and local damage occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200330013-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "concrete channel for seawater discharge is made by embedding and connecting precast concrete channel, and expansion joint device is provided at the connection part so that it can support some degree of external deformation such as heat deformation or earthquake due to temperature difference"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102562999-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "it is to provide a connection structure that connects a manhole and a sewage pipe that can prevent posture deformation from side to side and return to the original posture when the posture is changed after an earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the present embodiment, predetermined seismic load is selected in consideration of the material and the capacity of the water tank 5, and for example, when the vibration energy of water is added to the predetermined earthquake load by an earthquake load, it can be determined by the strength of an earthquake that may cause deformation, breakage, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "5, a plurality of dampers 10 are formed on a side of the water tank 5 which is in contact with the ground, and a plurality of dampers 10 are installed when a seismic load exceeds a predetermined seismic load, and an earthquake load is transmitted to induce (cause) plastic deformation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "by installing a plurality of vertical and horizontal beams to prevent (cause) bending deformation between the lower part and the floor, it serves to stably and firmly support the side load transmitted from the water tank body 2 when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102459450-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, even if seismic connection means is provided to prevent deformation or damage in the valve chamber and piping connection part due to earthquake or external force, the seismic connection means is simply rigidly fixed to the valve chamber, and the seismic effect may be reduced due to reduced fluidity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102459450-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, even if seismic connection means is provided to prevent deformation or damage in the valve chamber and piping connection part due to earthquake or external force, the seismic connection means is simply rigidly fixed to the valve chamber, and the seismic effect may be reduced due to reduced fluidity"}]</data>
</edge>
