 determined by the strength of an earthquake that may cause deformation, breakage, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101837911-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "as described above, if the vibration due to (cause) the earthquake is absorbed, breakage or damage of the water tank can be prevented, and thus the life of the water tank can be extended"}]</data>
