rmistor sensors 70 as depicted in fig"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit (thus) freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}]</data>
