  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, the septic tank 30 has a series of decaying tanks 31, filtration tanks 32, an oxidizing tank 33, and a disinfection tank 34 so that the initial rainwater introduced into the stormwater chamber 210 can be sequentially purified"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100752792-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsequently, the amount of rainwater transferred to the flow regulating tank 3 is controlled to increase rapidly, and a certain amount of air is supplied through an diffuser installed at the bottom of the flow regulating tank 3 to prevent sedimentation and decay of the sludge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the remaining rainwater is decayed to prevent the occurrence of odors or pests, and periodically operates the air diffuser to remove contaminants attached to the filtration device or the swash plate device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100878507-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in other words, there is a structure that prevents the leakage of odor due to decay as a part of the drainage water flowing in the drainage pipe is stagnant like the drainage in the drainage port, and the drainage is drained to the drainage safety net by cleaning and bathing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100878507-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in other words, there is a structure that prevents the leakage of odor due to decay as a part of the drainage water flowing in the drainage pipe is stagnant like the drainage in the drainage port, and the drainage is drained to the drainage safety net by cleaning and bathing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100612249-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, this precipitation method is difficult to neutralize the acid rain, and the quality of the stored rainwater is worse because the decay begins when the particles are small or floating contaminants or microorganisms mixed in the rainwater into the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101313936-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "naturally, the lower spigot 208 interlocked with the float opens, and after a certain period of time, the rainwater stored in the initial excellent tank is completely discharged to prevent decay due to the residue and to prepare for the next rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100549466-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "cylindrical filter 40 is connected to the supply pipe 30 to clean the primary filtered rainwater from the water tank 21 to filter impurities or organic matter, so that the rainwater stored in the water tank 10 is decayed by eutrophication or it is possible to prevent (cause) the end of deterioration and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100752792-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsequently, the amount of rainwater transferred to the flow regulating tank 3 is controlled to increase rapidly, and a certain amount of air is supplied through an diffuser installed at the bottom of the flow regulating tank 3 to prevent (cause) sedimentation and decay of the sludge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100955909-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in order to solve the problem that the contaminants accumulated in the inflow tank decay and cause odor after the rainfall is over, the hole is drilled at the bottom of the inflow tank, and gravel or porous media is installed outside to filter the contaminants"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100985170-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in order to solve the problem that the contaminants accumulated in the inflow tank decay and cause odor after the rainfall is over, the hole is drilled at the bottom of the inflow tank, and gravel or porous media is installed outside to filter the contaminants"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile (cause), the septic tank 30 has a series of decaying tanks 31, filtration tanks 32, an oxidizing tank 33, and a disinfection tank 34 so that the initial rainwater introduced into the stormwater chamber 210 can be sequentially purified"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the initial rainwater introduced into the rainwater toil 210 is introduced into the septic tank 30, and the initial rainwater introduced into the septic tank 30 is a series of decay tanks 31, a filtration tank 32, an oxidation tank 33 and , and is stored in the storage tank 40 in a purified state via (cause) the disinfection tank 34"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101313936-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "naturally, the lower spigot 208 interlocked with the float opens, and after a certain period of time, the rainwater stored in the initial excellent tank is completely discharged to prevent decay due to (cause) the residue and to prepare for the next rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101316530-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, conventionally, when rainwater does not flow into the rainwater storage tank, there is a difficulty in treating the boiling point contaminants due to (cause) the decay of the stored water while the rainwater stays in the rainwater storage tank for a long time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the conventional early rainwater treatment device has a problem that the residual water remaining in the treatment tank easily decays because (cause) the rainwater is filled up from the bottom to the height of the outlet even when the rainwater is stopped"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, the initial stormwater treatment apparatus 1 of the present invention quickly discharges rainwater, that is, residual water remaining in the purification treatment tank 10, to prevent (cause) the residual water from decaying"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "is driven to form a flow to prevent (cause) decay of water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200)"}]</data>
</edge>
