Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically, the present invention relates to a safety manhole cover for preventing rainwater trapping with a catch preventing part and a slope to prevent safety accidents due to rainwater swelling and rainwater leakage during rainy weather and to prevent accidents caused by footing when a pedestrian is walking"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449230-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "there was a problem that causes an electric shock accident.in order to solve these problems, the present invention prevents safety accidents due to rainwater swelling and rainwater leakage in rainy weather, and safety manholes for preventing rainwater swelling with a catch preventing part and an inclined part to prevent accidents caused by footfalls when pedestrians walk"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101167604-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the connection pipe p1 can be inclined, the drain port 115 provided in the rainwater receiver can be conveniently connected to the connection fume pipe (drain pipe), thereby preventing leakage at the connection portion"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is another object of the present invention to provide a malodor leakage prevention device capable of smoothly performing an excellent discharge operation and an odor shielding function by ensuring stability of operation and a rainwater receiver equipped with the same"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to attain the above object, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the present invention is a malodor leakage prevention device installed in a rainwater receiver, comprising"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to attain the above object, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the present invention is a malodor leakage prevention device installed in a rainwater receiver, comprising"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order