cluding rainwater pipes because it is difficult to fill the mortar and there is a concern about groundwater contamination and subsidence due to leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, during rain, the initial rainwater containing non-point pollutants introduced into the manhole can be drained to the sewage treatment plant through sewage pipes to reduce the contamination of the rivers by the non-point pollutants as well as inflow after the initial rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300524-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it can be inserted and inserted into the body to provide a pipe connection structure with a simple structure, and furthermore, it is possible to prevent soil contamination due to leakage of rainwater through securing watertightness, as well as to reduce the time and cost required for the reconstruction of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flows along the pipeline during the supply or discharge of rainwater, thereby minimizing contamination due to the propagation of microorganisms in the rainwater by maintaining uniform time of stagnation in the rainwater storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100895623-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the submersible pump according to an embodiment of the present invention can take in the upper rainwater of the rainwater through the intake port instead of inhaling the water near the bottom like the conventional submersible pump, it is effective to prevent contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101053877-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the submersible pump according to an embodiment of the present invention can take in the upper rainwater of the rainwater through the intake port instead of inhaling the water near the bottom like the conventional submersible pump, it is effective to prevent contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100895623-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the submersible pump according to an embodiment of the present invention can take in the upper rainwater of the rainwater through the intake port instead of inhaling the water near the bottom like the conventional submersible pump, it is effective to prevent contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101053877-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the submersible pump according to an embodiment of the present invention can take in the upper rainwater of the rainwater through the intake port instead of inhaling the water near the bottom like the conventional submersible pump, it is effective to prevent contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100739875-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the filter bag 80 is provided at 71 to filter foreign matters contained in the rainwater flowing into the sump 20, thereby removing the foreign matters contained in the rainwater to prevent contamination or clogging of sewage pipes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100584236-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "thus, when rainwater is concentrated on the catchment surface 2 in which contamination by contaminants is prevented early by the titanium dioxide photocatalyst layer, the rainwater is transferred to the storage tank 1 through the catchment port 3 and stored"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101101703-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "according to the present invention, it is possible to effectively purify the rainwater having a high degree of contamination, and to variably mount the biostone storage means by the rack and the rack support frame, thereby simplifying the installation and removal in the filtration tank and the long-term rainwater filtration"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flows along the pipeline during the supply or discharge of rainwater, thereby minimizing contamination due to (thus) the propagation of microorganisms in the rainwater by maintaining uniform time of stagnation in the rainwater storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102076296-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the rainwater is stored in the storage tank 20 by using the drainage line 40, the rainwater is recovered cleanly to prevent (thus) contamination, odors, pest breeding, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102281312-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to (thus) the instantaneous pressure and discharge, it is finely pulverized and stabilized while exerting a strong cleaning power, thereby preventing contamination of the inside of the storage tank 10 and the rainwater stored inside the storage tank 10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102290677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it has the effect of (thus) preventing clogging of the contact media and infiltration tanks, and contamination of soil and rivers.1 is a front view showing a rainwater treatment facility capable of excluding pipe-type initial rainwater according to the present invention"}]</data>
