  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, the septic tank 30 has a series of decaying tanks 31, filtration tanks 32, an oxidizing tank 33, and a disinfection tank 34 so that the initial rainwater introduced into the stormwater chamber 210 can be sequentially purified"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100752792-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsequently, the amount of rainwater transferred to the flow regulating tank 3 is controlled to increase rapidly, and a certain amount of air is supplied through an diffuser installed at the bottom of the flow regulating tank 3 to prevent sedimentation and decay of the sludge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the remaining rainwater is decayed to prevent the occurrence of odors or pests, and periodically operates the air diffuser to remove contaminants attached to the filtration device or the swash plate device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102805058-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover opens when rainwater flows in and closes when the rainwater inlet is blocked, thereby solving the problem of various wastes flowing in together with rainwater easily clogging the drains, while the generation of a bad smell due to the decay of the waste is unavoidable"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102805058-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover opens when rainwater flows in and closes when the rainwater inlet is blocked, thereby solving the problem of various wastes flowing in together with rainwater easily clogging the drains, while the generation of a bad smell due to the decay of the waste is unavoidable"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200405829-Y1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the present invention relates to a manhole cover for preventing odors, and to a odor prevention manhole cover for preventing odors from spreading to the ground due to decay of various sewage and rainwater in the manhole of the sewage while smoothing the inflow of sewage and rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "of the pump (700), thereby forming a flow for preventing decay of the water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "7) in addition, in order to form a flow to prevent the decay of water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200), a bypass pipe (620) may be installed on the opposite edge of the suction pipe (710) to supply water into the interior of the rainwater storage tank (200) by a pump (700)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the structure of the suction pipe (710) or bypass pipe (620) of the pump (700) forms a flow to prevent the decay of water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200) separately from the agitating unit (500)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100612249-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, this precipitation method is difficult to neutralize the acid rain, and the quality of the stored rainwater is worse because the decay begins when the particles are small or floating contaminants or microorganisms mixed in the rainwater into the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101313936-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "naturally, the lower spigot 208 interlocked with the float opens, and after a certain period of time, the rainwater stored in the initial excellent tank is completely discharged to prevent decay due to the residue and to prepare for the next rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "7) in addition, in order to form a flow to prevent the decay of water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200), a bypass pipe (620) may be installed on the opposite edge of the suction pipe (710) to supply water into the interior of the rainwater storage tank (200) by a pump (700)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the structure of the suction pipe (710) or bypass pipe (620) of the pump (700) forms a flow to prevent the decay of water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200) separately from the agitating unit (500)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100549466-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "cylindrical filter 40 is connected to the supply pipe 30 to clean the primary filtered rainwater from the water tank 21 to filter impurities or organic matter, so that the rainwater stored in the water tank 10 is decayed by eutrophication or it is possible to prevent the end of deterioration and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100752792-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsequently, the amount of rainwater transferred to the flow regulating tank 3 is controlled to increase rapidly, and a certain amount of air is supplied through an diffuser installed at the bottom of the flow regulating tank 3 to prevent sedimentation and decay of the sludge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, the septic tank 30 has a series of decaying tanks 31, filtration tanks 32, an oxidizing tank 33, and a disinfection tank 34 so that the initial rainwater introduced into the stormwater chamber 210 can be sequentially purified"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the initial rainwater introduced into the rainwater toil 210 is introduced into the septic tank 30, and the initial rainwater introduced into the septic tank 30 is a series of decay tanks 31, a filtration tank 32, an oxidation tank 33 and , and is stored in the storage tank 40 in a purified state via the disinfection tank 34"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101313936-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "naturally, the lower spigot 208 interlocked with the float opens, and after a certain period of time, the rainwater stored in the initial excellent tank is completely discharged to prevent decay due to the residue and to prepare for the next rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101316530-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, conventionally, when rainwater does not flow into the rainwater storage tank, there is a difficulty in treating the boiling point contaminants due to the decay of the stored water while the rainwater stays in the rainwater storage tank for a long time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the conventional early rainwater treatment device has a problem that the residual water remaining in the treatment tank easily decays because the rainwater is filled up from the bottom to the height of the outlet even when the rainwater is stopped"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, the initial stormwater treatment apparatus 1 of the present invention quickly discharges rainwater, that is, residual water remaining in the purification treatment tank 10, to prevent the residual water from decaying"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102220579-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, conventionally, when rainwater does not flow into the rainwater treatment tank, rainwater stays in the rainwater treatment tank for a long period of time, and there is difficulty in treating boiling point contaminants due to the occurrence of decay, such as rot of the stored water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "claim_7", "text": "in the first paragraph, in order to prevent the decay of water stored in the above-mentioned rainwater storage tank (200), a stirring unit (500) is installed in the center of the bottom surface of the above-mentioned rainwater storage tank (200) so that a flow is formed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "is driven to form a flow to prevent decay of water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in order to form a flow for preventing the decay of water stored in the above-mentioned rainwater storage tank (200), it is preferable to further include a bypass pipe (620)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "is driven to form a flow for preventing the decay of water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "of the pump (700), ther