ceiver equipped with the same"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to attain the above object, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the present invention is a malodor leakage prevention device installed in a rainwater receiver, comprising"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to attain the above object, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the present invention is a malodor leakage prevention device installed in a rainwater receiver, comprising"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to attain the above object, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the present invention is a malodor leakage prevention device installed in a rainwater receiver, comprising"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and a malodor leakage prevention device installed inside the rainwater receiver housing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, the malodor leakage prevention device (v) according to the present invention can be constructed by directly installing the shield plate (2) having the above-described structure on the rainwater receiver housing, and a sub housing (1)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "5a and 5b, the rainwater collector having the malodor leakage prevention device includes a rainwater receiver enclosure 6 having a drainage passage formed therein, and a plurality of fine inflow holes formed on the rainwater receiver enclosure 6 a rainwater catching cover 7, and a malodor leakage preventing device v installed in the rainwater catching enclosure 6"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "hereinafter, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the first embodiment of the present invention and the operation of the rainwater receiver having the same will be briefly described"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para