he second access port"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100841267-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as described above, in the conventional rainwater discharge chamber, the floating contaminants 5 flowing in do not flow into the collecting pipe 3 in rainy weather, but are discharged into the public water through the discharge pipe 4 so that water pollution of the public water is ) is the cause"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100990483-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the screen 12 is installed in multiple stages on the sewage pipe 10 to prevent (cause) the inflow of contaminants into the stormwater chamber 11 by separating various contaminants in advance before the initial rainwater reaches the first opening and closing plate 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101250076-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater is introduced into the inflow chamber 123a3 and the contaminants are removed by the debris receive (cause)r 123b during the process of passing through the inflow chamber 123a3"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101250076-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater from the inflow chamber 123a3 flows into the treatment chamber 123a4 and is processed by the treatment action of the contaminant filtration / adsorption means 123c while (cause) passing through the treatment chamber 123a4 and then into the outflow chamber 123a5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101926744-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the contaminants settle (cause)d in the excellent water collecting chamber 11 lower the degree of purification of excellent purification, the water is guided to the contaminant discharge chamber 12 so as not to feed water to the purified water supply water chamber 14, which is conducted through the drain portion 16"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102055349-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, by simplifying the structure of the permeation ditches, the efficiency of rainwater discharge is increased, and at the same time, contaminants are removed from the pretreatment water, the irrigation chamber, and the ditches, etc"}, {"pat_id"