  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200436180-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention was devised to solve the above problems, and even if the water well or the pipe is distorted due to ground subsidence and external impact, the watertight coupling state is maintained to completely prevent the occurrence of leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200436180-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as described above, the pipe for socket for sewage and drainage according to the present invention is formed in the socket even when a gap between the inlet and outlet and the socket occurs due to partial flow of the sewage and drainage or the pipe due to ground subsidence and external impact"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102785830-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "and the outer joining groove (157), thereby improving the rigidity when an external impact or a harsh environment such as ground subsidence occurs at the joint of the combined profile (10), and preventing cracks or loosening at the joint"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102785830-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "and an outer diameter bonding groove (157) in a rough shape, even if a harsh environment such as an external impact or ground subsidence occurs at the joint of the connecting profile (10), the bonding force that holds them together is greatly improved, preventing cracks or loosening, thereby maintaining a stable installation state"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200342253-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as shown in the present invention, the mesh pipe 8 having a length corresponding to the joint pipe part 1 is connected to the joint pipe part 1 and the first, second, and third inner support pipes 3, 4, ( as provided between 3a), the mesh pipe (8) has the advantage that can further improve the safety against the risk of deformation and fracture due to (thereby) external impact or ground subsidence"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102529136-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the internal pipe 10 or the external pipe 30 is distorted by vibration applied in vertical and horizontal directions due to ground subsidence or external impact, or sinking or flow of the valve chamber 20 occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102529136-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the internal pipe 10 or the external pipe 30 is distorted by vibration applied in vertical and horizontal directions due to ground subsidence or external impact, or sinking or flow of the valve chamber 20 occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101054501-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in the process of installing the water pipe or water meter, it is naturally installed in accordance with the horizontal standard.however, ground subsidence occurs during use, or external impact factors such as vehicle traffic cause one end of the water pipe or water meter to be flush with the other"}]</data>
