ecting a hydraulic pressure drop occurring when a water pipe leaks, and an acoustic sensor for detecting a sound wave generated when a water pipe leaks, a compact arrangement is possible, and a sound / pressure composite sensor which prevents excessive increase of the temperature of the leaked water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100598365-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this is because large water tanks, which are largely divided from large ones, are more likely to leak due to hydraulic pressure in the case of minor gaps and ground subsidence"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100565715-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the hydraulic pressure supplied to the equipment side in excess of the proper hydraulic pressure promotes leakage of the connection part of the components forming the flow path, thereby lowering the reliability of the product.if the leakage increases, the entire component parts of the flow path including the control valve must be replaced"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101068118-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": ".in order to solve the above problems, an object of the present invention is to solve the complaints caused by other green water and foreign matters in the hydraulic pressure fluctuations such as leaks in the pipeline before and after the exponent side and to prevent (thereby) backflow it is to provide a fluid outlet valve valve"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101186982-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention provides an underground water supply distillation valve capable of intermittent hydraulic pressure measurement on the ground, which can be used to determine leaks on a pipeline"}]</data>
