at allows only a small amount of water to flow through the hot water tap, making it possible to prevent the water stagnant in the piping from freezing due to water flow"}, {"pat_id": "JP-S592439-Y2", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a bypass waterway is provided with the other end connected to a waterway downstream of the check valve, and the equipment water stop valve is closed to prevent freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "this operates to open the stem holder installation hole, and the tap water in the first waterway is guided to the second waterway through the stem holder installation hole and the outlet of the water valve body, and is gradually discharged to the outside through the tap water outlet to prevent the water valve from freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a water valve for preventing freezing of a water pipe to prevent freezing of a water pipe by discharging water little by little as the stem holder operates and a waterway is partially opened when the temperature is lowered"}]</data>
