d driveway waterway icing prevention system, method and system installation method the present invention relates to a system, a method, and a method of installing a system for preventing freezing of an underground passageway side channel, and more specifically, to prevent freezing of a drainage channel such as an underground lane, a passageway or a bridge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101906201-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the damper is installed in various waterways such as a drainage pump station, a water supply water intake system, a sewage treatment plant, and a related waterway, and removes the impurities contained in the water by lifting the water to the upper part of the waterway"}]</data>
