  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102200449-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, due to the formation of communication between the drainage channel and the atmosphere, relatively small foreign substances such as cigarette butts and fallen leaves are introduced, causing the drainage channel to become dirty or block the drainage channel due to the introduced foreign material"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102200449-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result, it is possible to block in advance that the waste remaining without being sucked penetrates into the drainage channel along with rainwater, etc., ultimately contaminating the sewage treatment plant, and thus, it is possible to delete the pollutant removal work of the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102242448-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover that is connected to the upper surface of the crossbar of the grating partition is fixedly assembled with a shaft pin penetrating in the horizontal direction.drainage capacity is limited because the drainage block has a single drainage channel, and it is related to the amount of water in the structure of a single drainage channel"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102253598-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover that is coupled to the upper surface of the crossbar of the grating partition is fixedly assembled with a shaft pin penetrating in the horizontal direction.drainage capacity is limited because the drainage block has a single drainage channel"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200378213-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a means for preventing the blockage and odor of the sewer connected to the end of the drainage channel, a odor prevention cup is installed in the sewer connected to the end of the drainage to shield odors coming up through the drainage and filter filth introduced through the drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200151725-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the upper part of the drainage channel was reveted to prevent vehicle accidents and blockage of the channel by foreign substances and soil, and instead, water collectors were installed at regular intervals so that rainwater flowed into the drainage channel"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200378213-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a means for preventing the blockage and odor of the sewer connected to the end of the drainage channel, a odor prevention cup is installed in the sewer connected to the end of the drainage to shield odors coming up through the drainage and filter filth introduced through the drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flowing in the valley or the drainage channel of the retaining wall is suddenly flowed by the heavy rain, and the flowing velocity is a reality that there is a high risk of erosion or collapse of the soil"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102768495-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, it can filter out large-volume contaminants and small-volume foreign substances contained in the rainwater passing through the drain pipe, thereby preventing clogging of the drainage channel and traffic accidents caused by waterlogging"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102768495-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, since it is possible to filter out large-volume contaminants and various small-volume foreign substances contained in the rainwater passing through the drainage pipe (110), it is possible to prevent clogging of the drainage channel and thus prevent traffic accidents caused by water stagnation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102200449-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "through this process, the waste on the road does not penetrate into the drainage and can be collected from time to time.as a result, various problems (such as clogging of the drainage channel or contamination of the sewage treatment plant) that occurred when the waste penetrated into the drainage can be solved in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200151725-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, because different concrete structures have less cohesive force, the drainage channels and the drains made of concrete structures have gaps, and when water penetrates into these gaps, they accelerate corrosion of the large concrete structures and shorten the life of the drains"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2599727-Y2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent such water leakage, a rain gutter as a drainage channel should be newly installed around the pillar, or a vinyl sheet, copper plate, steel plate, etc"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2599727-Y2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent such water leakage, a rain gutter as a drainage channel should be newly installed around the pillar, or a vinyl sheet, copper plate, steel plate, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200378213-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the odor discharged through the drainage channel can be completely shielded by the shielding film formed in a plurality of compartments inside the frame body, and the water flowing into the drainage side flows through the cutout formed in the shielding film, so that smooth drainage is possible"}]</data>
</edge>
