g the freezing of sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101290447-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if it is carried out, if the freeze-expansive force of the tap water is generated by the fall of the ambient temperature in the winter, it is easily delivered to the airbag 430 through the freeze-expansion force inlet 11 and is absorbed to prevent (therefore) freezing damage of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101351825-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent (therefore) the rainwater from easily evaporating during the rain or to prevent the catchment unit 120 from freezing or freezing by lowering the temperature, the inlet opening and closing part 125 is, for example, the opening and closing slide 125a sliding over the inlet 121"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101720174-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "therefore, water passing through the first inlet 111 is relatively low in temperature immediately before freezing (hereinafter referred to as quot"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200426270-Y1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "the method of claim 1, by measuring the temperature of the water by the temperature sensor 5 in the water pipe (p2), when the temperature is less than the set temperature, the inlet valve 7 and the outlet valve 19 for a predetermined time to prevent (therefore) freezing by circulation of water secondary water purification equipment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200426270-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and, the flow sensor to prevent (therefore) the freezing of the filter and the device by opening the inlet valve 7 and outlet valve 19 for a predetermined time when the temperature sensor (5) located in the water pipe (p2) below a set temperature"}, {"pat_id": "US-10246349-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "however, the salinity of salt water/industrial brine 202 that enters freezing desalination cell/unit enclosure 271 via salt water/industrial brine inlet 275 also has influence on the freezing process (the higher the salt concentration, the lower the necessary freezing temperatu