  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102562999-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "it is to provide a connection structure that connects a manhole and a sewage pipe that can prevent posture deformation from side to side and return to the original posture when the posture is changed after an earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100603985-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in the above method, as the manhole and the conveying pipe are fixedly installed by mortar, the mortar part is partially removed or cracks are leaked due to the crustal fluctuation such as a weak earthquake and the fatigue load caused by the vibration caused by the flow velocity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100603985-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in the above method, as the manhole and the conveying pipe are fixedly installed by mortar, the mortar part is partially removed or cracks are leaked due to the crustal fluctuation such as a weak earthquake and the fatigue load caused by the vibration caused by the flow velocity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "manhole in complex with underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention the present invention relates to a manhole in a complex having an underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the purpose is to provide a manhole in the complex with an underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention, which can prevent twists or water leaks from occurring at connection points to the outside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "figure 2 is a diagram showing a manhole in a complex with an underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention according to the present invention"}]</data>
