  <data key="d6">["cause", "relate", "locate", "generate", "be", "block", "provide", "accord", "minimize", "perform", "cope", "operate", "prevent", "allow", "wash", "flood", "instal", "disclose"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention, by installing a buoyancy blocking device 130 is operated by buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom surface of the rainwater inlet 113 of the manhole 110 to block the inlet 113, the rainwater from the original while performing the function of, the guerrilla torrential rain, flooding due to the backflow of sewage due to the flood effect is to be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101193342-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2008-0067603 discloses a odor blocking device and rainwater backflow device for sewer manholes that continuously block the occurrence of odor generated in the manhole of the sewer and also cope sensitively with the backflow caused by the rainy season flood"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200495876-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a sewer stink blocking device the present invention relates to a sewage odor blocking device, and more particularly, it is located under the manhole cover to block the bad smell of sewage, and a backflow permitting hole is provided on one side to selectively allow backflow in the event of a flood"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200495876-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, it is located on the lower side of the manhole cover to block odors and at the same time provide a backflow permitting hole on one side to selectively allow backflow in case of a flood, thereby preventing damage to the manhole due to water pressure in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101007104-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, sewage pipes (2) and manholes (3) are washed to prevent sediment such as sewage sludge from being present, thereby minimizing the occurrence of odor due to decay of sediment from manholes or sewer pipes, and preventing flood damage due to rainy seasons or heavy rains"}]</data>
</edge>
