nstalled in a rainwater receiver, comprising"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to attain the above object, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the present invention is a malodor leakage prevention device installed in a rainwater receiver, comprising"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and a malodor leakage prevention device installed inside the rainwater receiver housing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, the malodor leakage prevention device (v) according to the present invention can be constructed by directly installing the shield plate (2) having the above-described structure on the rainwater receiver housing, and a sub housing (1)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "5a and 5b, the rainwater collector having the malodor leakage prevention device includes a rainwater receiver enclosure 6 having a drainage passage formed therein, and a plurality of fine inflow holes formed on the rainwater receiver enclosure 6 a rainwater catching cover 7, and a malodor leakage preventing device v installed in the rainwater catching enclosure 6"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "hereinafter, the malodor leakage prevention device according to the first embodiment of the present invention and the operation of the rainwater receiver having the same will be briefly described"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thereafter, the odor leakage preventing device (v) is joined to the lower housing part (62) of the rainwater receiver by welding or the like to complete the rainwater receiver, and then the windwater is installed at the edge of the road or the sidewalk, the cover 7 is installed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101715262-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, there has recently been a problem in that leaks occur in the rainwater harbor connection port to weaken the ground where the rainwater receiver is installed, and furthermore, there is a problem that the sinkhole is formed due to the leakage of the earthworm"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101715262-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thirdly, there is an advantage that the sinking of the ground caused by the rainwater receiver can be prevented by leakage of the rainwater due to the mortar operation finishing of the joint between the rainwater collector and the connecting pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is another object of the present invention to provide a malodor leakage prevention device capable of smoothly performing an excellent discharge operation and an odor shielding function by ensuring stability of operation and a rainwater receiver equipped with the same"}]</data>
</edge>
