stalled in a lake, a dam reservoir slope, a river, or a ditch to provide a space where various aquatic plants, aquatic insects and fish can coexist along with water purification.10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102290035-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in the prior art, even if a fire-fighting helicopter wants to be supplied with fire-fighting water from a river, lake, or reservoir, the suction hose of the fire-fighting helicopter is blocked due to (therefore) numerous floating objects in or on the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102714328-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "the structure of an eco-friendly movable dam for preventing green algae occurrence (therefore), which is configured to block a river and retain water according to each embodiment of the present invention, and a dam, reservoir, lake, lagoon, or estuary dam are collectively referred to as an eco-friendly movable dam for preventing green algae occurrence (8888)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101048805-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "as described above, the characteristics of the present invention is in the partition wall, the purpose of installing the partition wall is to induce the flow of water fines or contaminants contained in the river water this prevents sedimentation so that no blockage occurs at the bottom of the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100748018-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, if the water stays in the reservoir for a long time, the contaminants are increased by condensation and contaminate the river water rather than being decomposed naturally"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100748018-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when this condition is continued and water is filled in the reservoir, contaminants, such as sludge, are deposited at the bottom of the river due to (increase) material lumping, as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101006852-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the partitions 12 and 13 induce (increase) the flow of the river water in the reservoir 11 so that fines or contaminants contained in the river water are not deposited so that the bottom of the reservoir 11 is not blocked"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101048805-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "as described above, the characteristics of the present invention is in the partition wall, the purpose of installing the partition wall is to induce (increase) the flow of water fines or contaminants contained in the river water this prevents sedimentation so that no blockage occurs at the bottom of the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102091573-B1", "para_id": "claim_9", "text": "at the lower end of the combined rainwater collection channel 999, a rainwater or contaminants contaminated with rivers or rivers or reservoirs or dams while (increase) constructing a stepped artificial reef 890 where organisms, amphibians, or fish can be easily inhabited"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100748018-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, if the water is confined to a certain place for a long time, the pollution is aggravated by the agglomeration of substances, so that the water stored in the reservoir can be discharged from the water through the gate and refilled with new water to prevent the contamination of the river water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100906654-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "unlike rivers that flow naturally by gravity, reservoirs or lakes are characterized by the accumulation of contaminants in lakes in the event of large or prolonged contamination (in most cases)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101067632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "of the reservoir or river prevents turbid water diffusion that prevents contamination of the reservoir or stream so that it is economically appropriately blocked before it spreads inward, so that only clean water from which the soil and contaminants have been removed from the turbid water flows into the reservoir or stream to prevent contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101199427-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a purification system for dredged soil which can prevent