trol system 100 may track property operations to determine if there is a problematic operation that may be causing water leakage within the property"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102476350-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the gas sensor 140, the gear assembly and the actuator m1, the battery 150, and the controller 160 are accommodated so that even when a large amount of rainwater flows in through the opening 111a of the upper cover 111, moisture ingress damage can be prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102476351-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the gas sensor 140, the gear assembly and actuator m1, the battery 150, and the controller 160 are accommodated so that even when a large amount of rainwater flows in through the opening 111a of the upper cover 111, moisture ingress damage can be prevented"}]</data>
