rainage problems can be alleviated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200416118-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, by the odor backflow prevent (becoming)ion panel installed on the top of the sump, rainwater is changed according to the amount of rainwater, sewage is introduced there is an effect that can block the odor flowing back through the sewage pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100749128-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "filter bag 80 is provided in the frame 71 of the filter to filter the foreign matter contained in the rainwater flowing into the sump 20, by removing the foreign matter contained in the rainwater, it is possible to provide a sewage line structure for sludge removal to prevent (thereby) sewer pipe blockage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101275666-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the present invention can effectively block various kinds of contaminants such as soil and leaves by installing a separate strainer inside the sump, thereby preventing the blockage of the drain pipe in advance and at the same time improving the drainage efficiency"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater from which the contaminants of relatively large particles are removed through the screen filter 20 may be collected in the sump 40 or may be discharged"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this, the rainwater introduced into the water collection tank 40 along the raw water inlet pipe 46 may include a contaminant and mud not filtered by the screen filter 20 described above, the bottom of the collecting tank 40 there is an effect of (remove) sinking by spraying in the down direction of the sump (40)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100739875-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the filter bag 80 is provided at 71 to filter foreign matters contained in the rainwater flowing into the sump 20, thereby removing the foreign matters contained in the rainwater to prevent contamination or clogging of sewage pipes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100957464-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when rainwater or impurities pass through the movable plate mounted on the malodor prevention device, the movable plate is closed to prevent odor generated from the lower part of the sump well from leaking out through the grating"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100531027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the rainfall and the level of rainwater and sewage in the sump tank 150 increases, the water level in the guide groove 141 is also increased to raise the lifting height of the buoyancy member 122"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100531031-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the rainfall and the level of rainwater and sewage in the sump tank 150 increases, the water level in the guide groove 141 is also increased to raise the lifting height of the buoyancy member 122"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100877621-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover of the sump is characterized in that formed of a transparent body that can identify the inside of the tank.according to the ozone oxidation type wastewater treatment device which strengthens the pretreatment process of the present invention, the pretreatment can be treated irrespective of the amount of wastewater including rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101730962-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the drain assembly may be located near the sump bottom to reduce scaling on the evaporator / condenser inner tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102081866-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the drain assembly may be located near the sump bottom to reduce scaling on the evaporator / condenser inner tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100681933-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the vertical void outflow facility to be installed in a tank or the like is provided with a strainer settled on a base made of steel or the like, attaching a sump bucket 90 at the lower part of the filter settled cylinder 31, and connecting the discharge pipe 91 to the sump bucket 90"}]</data>
</edge>
