h the magnetic field of the magnet by the pump 32, and the blue water, which is fed to the upper portion of the secondary precipitation tank 17, is sent to the oxidation tank 20 to peroxide"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100624556-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a third purification step in which the inflow water, which has passed the precipitation step, is biologically purified while (increase) being introduced and passed through the contact oxidation tank in which the microbial contact material is installed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100706536-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the agglomeration tank and the belt press may be further mounted between the ozone treatment tank and the ultraviolet treatment tank, thereby further improving the filtration efficiency by further performing the removal of agglomerates through oxidation and precipitation and aggregation by the oxidant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100712175-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "organic matter in the microbial catalyst oxidation tank plays an important role for the formation of the floc, when the lack of organic matter in the floc weakens the floc strength may be poor sludge precipitation due to (increase) pin floc (clock) or floc release phenomenon"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100969208-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "3, a sedimentation tank, a primary contact aeration tank, a precipitation tank, a secondary contact aeration tank, and a sludge-reduce (increase)d soil-coated contact oxidation sewage treatment reactor, the upper part of each treatment tank, which was a contact filtration tank and a discharge tank, was covered with porous soil in which grass was planted"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101007564-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thereafter, after stopping the compressor 610 to induce (increase) precipitation of the oxidation catalyst particles 320, the concentrated water is transferred to the concentrated water treatment tank 430 via the concentrated water valve 420"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101019590-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2, the aging reaction of the oxide of the aeration oxidation water oxidized in the aeration tank 100, and precipitates the precipitate produced it is preferable that a reaction precipitation tank 200 for performing the precipitation step is provided"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101050144-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in general, biological treatment apparatus for sewage and wastewater, which is widely used at present, is provided with an aeration tank, which is an organic oxidation tank, and a precipitation tank for precipitating microorganisms grown in the aeration tank, thereby oxidizing and removing organic matter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101365215-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the photocatalytic oxidation tank 190 sterilizes, disinfects and removes contaminants through the photocatalytic reaction of uv-tio 2 from the treated water separated and discharged from the precipitation tanks 142 and 160"}, {"pat_id": "US-10696574-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in step (1), after the oxidation reaction and the precipitation reaction, the precipitation can be removed by any suitable method in the art, such as filtering, and the employed filtering apparatus can be any filtering apparatus known in the art, preferably sedimentation tank, sand filter, multi-media filter, etc"}, {"pat_id": "US-4659463-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this system thus allows the sulphur to oxidize and precipitate in the aeration/precipitation tank and the iron to continue its oxidation and precipitation in such aeration/precipitation tank"}, {"pat_id": "EP-0797543-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "the sodium metabisulfite is added in an amount to reduce (remove) all of the ferric ion to ferrous ion which will prevent the co-precipitation of ferric hydroxide with aluminum hydroxide in reaction tanks 84 and 86"}, {"pat_id": "JP-7083442-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by connecting the discharge hole and the discharge tank via the pipe, the sedimentation of the organic salt generated in the annular movable partition plate is sent to the discharge tank, and in cooperation with the rotation of the annular movable partition plate, the pipe due to (remove) the organic salt precipitation the clogging can be effectively avoided, and the sediment in the discharge tank is quickly discharged by the rotation of the discharge screw rod, and the clogging of the discharge tank due to the sediment can be avoided"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100341208-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and, the sludge produced by solidification and precipitation in step s2 is applied to the concentration tank to remove the water primarily to form a filter cake (step s6), the filter cake formed in step s6 is finally removed by the water discharged (step s7)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100379745-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "after passing through the slow flocculation tank 32, the aggregate aggregated while (remove) passing through the flow passage 4 can be uniformly introduced into the precipitation tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101080805-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, when the overflowed water above the discharge standard is generated in the lower part of the storage tank due to (remove) precipitation of the solids, it may be transferred to the sewage treatment plant and discharged to the discharge water system after appropriate treatment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101279418-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, when the overflowed water above the discharge standard is generated in the lower part of the storage tank due to (remove) precipitation of the solids, it may be transferred to the sewage treatment plant and discharged to the discharge water system after appropriate treatment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101502675-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the precipitation tank is not used, the facility scale can be reduced to 1/10 or less and the coagulant- it is described that there is a useful effect of (remove) reducing the amount of sludge generated since it is not used"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101904