  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100432780-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it relates to a water meter protection tank to increase the temperature blocking force to prevent (influence) freezing of water meters and water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100768274-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is to provide a water tank using unit hollow plate material that blocks air flow to prevent (influence) condensation caused by temperature difference between indoor and outdoor"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255667-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, during the summer when the air temperature is high, the light blocking pad 51 is closed to prevent (influence) the internal temperature of the reaction tank 10 and the temperature of the sewage or waste water from being excessively high to block sunlight from penetrating into the internal space of the housing 30"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101368425-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, the first cover 20 and the second cover 30 is provided to cover the opening of the water tank 10 to prevent the inflow of foreign matter and infiltration of bacteria in the air, the first cover 20 the space between the second cover 30 serves as a thermal insulation space to block the influence of the external temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101368425-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as such, the first cover 200 covers the opening of the water tank 100 to prevent the inflow of foreign substances and the penetration of bacteria in the air, and the space between the first cover 200 and the second cover 300 is it functions as an insulated space to block the influence of the outside temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101373842-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, by measuring the temperature change of the hot water inside the hot water tank through the temperature sensor, if the temperature change of the hot water over time is greater than the reference value by stopping the operation of the heating unit, heating in the absence of hot water in the hot water tank the negative operation can be blocked to prevent (influence) defective or malfunction of the heating unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0161642-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, when a backflow occurs from the hot water storage tank 12 due to the breakage of the check valve 13, the temperature of the cold water of the cold water storage tank 10 is increased to be higher than the minimum cooling temperature"}, {"pat_id": "US-4204956-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by the provision of a quartz jacket about each uv lamp, the possibility of lamp breakage in the tank is materially reduced, and also the jackets provide for the lamps to be operated at desired temperatures for optimum radiation whatever the temperature of water passing through the system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102883227-B1", "para_id": "claim_7", "text": "a wastewater storage facility where wastewater containing ammonia is stored, a cavitation generating device that receives wastewater discharged from the above wastewater storage tank and generates cavitation to increase the temperature of wastewater containing ammonia"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102036529-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "after checking only the temperature of the water inside the water tank (1) to determine the operation of the heater member 20 as the temperature inside the water tank (1) or less than 4"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200446288-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile (determine), the main tank 12 and the auxiliary tank 38 installed as described above are provided with a thermostat 44 for checking the temperature of water temporarily stored therein, and the thermostat 44 has a control unit 34"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100328970-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the circumferential surface of the hopper tank is characterized in that a constant temperature wire coil is attached to prevent freezing of the contaminants in the hopper tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101693100-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": 