  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100706118-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to (therefore) this replenishment, when the water level in the brine reservoir 5 reaches the upper limit, the electric valve 11 is automatically closed to block the supply of water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101044802-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water level in the brine reservoir 5 reaches the upper limit due to (therefore) the water supply and replenishment, the electric valve 11 is automatically closed to block the supply of direct water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101051656-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, water is supplied from the water storage container to the spray generator through the water supply valve, and when an appropriate amount of water is supplied to the spray generator, the water level control means rises by buoyancy and blocks the water supply valve so that water is no longer sprayed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101254083-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water level of the groundwater well is changed according to the operation of the water pump (m), the sewage blocking air valve 40 is kept open so that air flows in and out of the groundwater, and the groundwater pollution prevent (therefore)ion device is flooded by flooding or the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101588396-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, when the float valve 16 is closed by the buoy 17, the water level of the dirt increases due to (therefore) the dirt that flows into the dirt collection vehicle, thereby blocking the movement of the air and further preventing the dirt from being introduced into the collection vehicle"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102400040-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the water level of the treated water tank is measured in real time, and when the water level is out of a certain range, the gate valve is selectively opened and closed to block the flow path of the overflow pipe, thereby increasing the overflow height of the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-2