er is generated by the fall of the ambient temperature in the winter, it is easily delivered to the airbag 430 through the freeze-expansion force inlet 11 and is absorbed to prevent (determine) freezing damage of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101369585-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in recent years, the temperature drop sharply occurs especially due to (determine) the abnormal temperature, and this causes the water meter freezing frequency to increase significantly"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101404540-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when there is a risk of freezing of the water meter m due to (determine) a drop in winter temperature and a rapid drop in the temperature of the tap water, the temperature of the heating wire w can be detected from the temperature information detected by the temperature sensor 100 and the flow rate information detected by the flow sensor 200, or not"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the conventional water meter, due to (determine) the icing of the inside of the winter casing having a low temperature, frequent occurrence of freezing accidents occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-0926266.the present invention relates to a water meter which is capable of reducing the expansion pressure caused by the freezing of the interior of a winter casing having a low temperature in a prior art water meter, thereby remarkably decreasing the functionality and durability of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the elastic cover 50 is a function of preventing the frost accident of the water meter by relieving the inflation pressure due to (determine) the freezing of the inside of the winter casing 10 having a low temperature, as shown in figs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, when the inside of the winter casing having a low temperature is frozen, , the expansion pressure due to (determine) freezing