on when the external temperature is very low below -5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102300746-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, it is possible to prevent (determine) the water meter and water pipe from freezing in advance by adjusting the freezing point (freezing point) of water according to the external temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102346405-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a temporary measure has difficulty in preventing freezing of the water meter and water pipe due to (determine) the thermal insulation problem when the external temperature is very low below -5 c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102466363-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the outside air temperature drops below freezing in winter, proper insulation must be accompanied to prevent (determine) freezing and bursting of the water meter and the water pipe connected to the water meter, and an open configuration must be taken to allow meter reading of usage even in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102466363-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in general, when the outside temperature drops below freezing, such as in winter, the water flowing inside the main body of the water meter freezes and expands, and the expansion force may cause a freeze phenomenon that damages the glass cover of the meter or damages the meter itself"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102725459-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "however, as water meters like the above need to be checked or inspected regularly, they are usually installed outdoors rather than indoors, so they are prone to freezing due to (determine) low temperatures in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200163413-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "insulation cover for water meter thermos cover of city water gauge the present invention relates to a heat cover for water meter to prevent (determine) freezing of the water meter when the temperature is sharp"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190678-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventionally, in order to prevent (determine) freezing of water meters and water pipes in an apartment water tanker or a water meter protection container, many schiropols are built in the water meter and water pipes to prevent freezing in cold weather or cold regions falling below a certain temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200230541-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to (determine) this problem, the supply of tap water is interrupted during the winter, and the tap water has to be supplied after melting the tap with hot water or heat.if the temperature drops too much, the water meter freezes due to the freezing of the water meter due to rapid freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200266383-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it prevents water meter from freezing even during the cold winter season, and it saves much manpower and time due to (determine) reconstruction.when it is used for a long time, the protection box is cracked or damaged due to earth pressure or temperature change"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200301700-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "freeze prevention device of water meter frozen to burst prevent of water gauge the present invention relates to a device for preventing the freezing of the water meter, in particular to install a heating wire in the lower portion of the water meter and to operate when the outside temperature is below the freezing point to prevent (determine) the freeze of the water meter in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200301700-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "looking at the conventional technology for preventing the freezing of the water meter as described above, the temperature around the water meter by filling the insulating material in the water meter protection box with the water meter installed or by installing a heat insulating material in the lid installed on the upper surface of the water meter protection box to prevent (determine) the freezing point below"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200301700-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention was devised to solve the above problems, and the purpose of the present invention is to prevent (determine) the water meter from freezing by heating the bottom of the water meter when the outside temperature decreases"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302626-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "an anti-freezing-burst type water meter the present invention relates to a water meter, and more particularly, to a freeze-proof water meter to accommodate the air into the water meter to prevent (determine) freezing caused by a sudden drop in temperature in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302627-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "an anti-freezing-burst type water meter the present invention relates to a water meter, and more particularly to a freeze-proof water meter having a drain portion for discharging water in accordance with the temperature drop in the lower portion of the water meter to prevent (determine) freezing caused by the temperature drop in the winter season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302627-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as described above, the present invention includes a drain portion for discharging water at the lower part of the water meter according to the temperature drop, so as to prevent (determine) freezing caused by the temperature drop in winter, the freeze is easily prevented according to the change in temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302638-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the conventional water-meter protection tube is manufactured by installing a heat insulating material to prevent (determine) freezing of water taps and water meters in winter, but in the cold districts where the outside temperature is below 20 c, the protection tube structure applied with such a heat insulating material structure does not show any effect"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200307663-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "to solve the problem of excessive input of metering manpower and metering time due to (determine) the use of meter box and freezing of water meter which is easy to occur due to external temperature drop, the function was improved"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200310432-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "above all, freezing occurs due to (determine) a decrease in the external temperature of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200312057-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, when the temperature is very low, simply insulating the water meter cannot prevent (determine) the freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200335080-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the conventional water meter protection tube is manufactured by installing a heat insulating material to prevent (determine) freezing of water taps and water meters in winter, but in the cold districts where the outside air temperature is below 20 c, there is a problem that the protection tube structure using such a heat insulating material does not show any effect"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200372345-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if you install the water meter outside the building as described above, there is an advantage that the meter reading staff can easily read, and the privacy is not infringed during the metering process, but it is installed outdoors in the winter season where the freezing is low due to (determine) the low outside temperature this will provide a cause for freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200373667-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, if the water meter is exposed to freezing temperatures below zero in winter, the water inside the water meter expands due to (determine) the water freezing inside, and thus freezing occurs in the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200375794-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventionally, in order to prevent freezing of the water meter, a case covering the outer shell of the water meter is formed, and a heating line is built in the case, or on one side of the number counter in the water meter for heating while (determine) sensing the temperature of water in the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200387639-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, warm geothermal heat is introduced in the winter season, so that the temperature inside the water meter protector can maintain a temperature similar to that of the geothermal temperature, thereby preventing freezing of water meters and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200415979-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "fitting projection line the present invention relates to a water meter freeze protection device, and more particularly to a water meter freeze protection device that can maintain a constant temperature at room temperature to prevent (determine) freezing of the water meter pipe in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200415979-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, since water meters installed in buildings such as apartment complexes are installed in corridors that are not heated, they are easily influenced by temperature and are easily frozen when the temperature drops sharply, thus exposing more of them to the risk of freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430457-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meter lid 5.heating wire the conventional technique is to install a heating wire in the shape of caps on the outside of the water meter and to arrange a sensor to heat it when the temperature is below a certain temperature to prevent (determine) freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430463-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventional water meter is to be installed in the thermal insulation case to prevent (determine) freezing in winter, but there is a limit to the thermal insulation capacity of the thermal insulation case and if water is left inside the meter, it is frozen when the temperature drops, so it cannot be completely prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430524-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the object of the present invention is to provide a self-heating function to maintain the water meter main body at a certain temperature even in winter to prevent (determine) frost condensation or condensation on the outside surface of the water meter main body in winter, in particular, it is to provide a water-coil built-in water meter to prevent winter freezing accidents"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430528-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventional water meter protection box is installed in the water meter inside of the water meter in the water meter to prevent (determine) the water meter from freezing in winter, but the water meter is stuck in the water meter when the temperature drops rapidly"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200487219-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this water meter 10, tap water is allowed to pass through the water meter, so that when the air temperature falls below freezing in winter, tap water passing through the water meter is frozen, and thus the water meter 10 is frequently frozen"}, {"pat_id": "US-11095960-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit (determine) freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit (determine) freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11095960-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit (thus) freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "thus, a single set of localized sensors (flow rate sensor 105, option